<title>AUSTRIA: WIFO says unlikely to trim Austria growth forecast.</title>
<headline>WIFO says unlikely to trim Austria growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's semi-official economic research institute WIFO said on Friday it was unlikely to revise down its 1997 and 1998 growth forecasts for the country.</p>
<p>&quot;It is still a little early to say definitely but it seems we can rule out a downward revision,&quot; WIFO chief economist Helmut Kramer told Reuters.</p>
</text>
